# Packaging whitelist: everything is ignored, then what the extension needs at
# runtime is re-included. Check the result with `npx vsce ls --no-dependencies`.
#
# vsce gives "!" patterns priority over ignore patterns whatever their order, so
# an exclusion inside a re-included folder has to be written as an extglob: !(x).
**

!package.json
!package.nls.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!ThirdPartyNotices.txt
!THIRD_PARTY_LICENSE_vscode-mssql.txt

# Bundles produced by `npm run build:prod`; source maps are never shipped.
!dist/**/!(*.map)

# Icons used by the manifest, the tree views and the webview panels.
# media/icon.svg is only the source of media/icon.png.
!media/!(icon.svg|screenshots)
!media/objectTypes/**
